# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored - never commit real values.
#
# IMPORTANT: Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the client bundle,
# so everything here is PUBLIC and readable by anyone. Never a private API key,
# a JWT secret or an SMTP credential - those live in server/.env, which has no
# VITE_ prefix precisely so they cannot be inlined by accident.
#
# There is currently nothing the public bundle needs.
#
# VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT / VITE_FORM_ACCESS_KEY were removed in Phase 1c. The enquiry
# form posts to this site's own API at /api/enquiries, so there is no third-party
# form provider in the path any more. Submissions are stored in Postgres and shown
# under Enquiries in the admin; the notification email is configured server-side
# (SMTP_*, NOTIFY_EMAIL in server/.env.example).
